text = "RECIPES (since budget cuts killed the tutorial star)
Stove -------------------------
Dough > Bread
Sugar > Caramel
Pasta Dough > Pasta
Indigo Seeds > Indigo Spice
Egg > Omelette
Blender--------------------
Grain > Flour
Flour > Dough
Cutting Board -------------------
Bread > Bread Slice
Dough > Pasta Dough
Mixer ---------------------
Indigo Spice + Pasta > Indigo Pasta
Caramel + Bread > Sweet Roll
Sugar + Milk > Cream
Anything + Anything > Mix"

