text = "the game is simple:
At the start of the loop, You choose your destination planet.






After choosing your planet, you will need to make X amount of meals. Try to aim for meals with the correct size! After each voyage, difficulty increases, and you get a bonus machine, alongside a chance to restock.

For making meals, just try clicking boxes with items, and the large hole on the meal dropoff machine. Just click anything that looks clickable!"

